    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WAR. IT'S FANTASTIC!</h2>Inspired by real life events, GRENADE DRONE SIMULATOR puts you in control of the wackiest form of post-modern, asymmetric warfare around! Precision strikes, coordinated tactics, and grave moral quandaries are for the other guys... you know the best way to defend your community is dropping adult magazines in a playground to lure in the godless invaders and lobbing a grenade from the safety of your couch!<br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Realistic Drone Warfare!<br></li><li>Shockingly Accurate Point System!<br></li><li>Absolutely No Murder Zombots!<br></li><li>Top of the Line Graphics for 2003!<br></li><li>Sort of Fun!<br></li><li>I Can't Stress This Enough....NO MURDER ZOMBOTS!</li></ul>",
